ion URL; linked content unavailable.","status":"DEFERRED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u26.3250"},{"reason":"Footnote 2 marker linking to resubmission text.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u27.3328"},{"reason":"Separate resubmission obligation and promised guidance.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"reason":"Footnote 3 marker linking to certificate text.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u29.3563"},{"reason":"Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement for marked methods.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"}],"dimensions":[{"dimension":"scope","explanation":"The text defines “licensed firms” as “licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities”. The selected control concerns those actors' STR filings. Whether an entity is an associated entity remains a classification question.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0","da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"definitions","explanation":"STREAMS 2 replaces STREAMS. The three listed methods are XML, completed prescribed PDF upload, and the STREAMS 2 web form. “Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate)” is required for the XML and PDF items marked with footnote 3; the packet does not define the technical act that satisfies it.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u1.383","da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u6.1149","da12aecad4e68.u29.3563","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"exceptions","explanation":"During the blackout, urgent STR matters are directed to contact the JFIU by email, phone or fax. That contact route is separate from the post-launch STREAMS 2 rule. The source separately requires re-submission of STRs made through other channels “following its implementation”; it does not expressly say that every blackout contact is an STR submission or state a resubmission deadline.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"modality","explanation":"“are required to submit” and “are required to follow” express mandatory wording. Registration and transitional arrangements use “should”; urgent contact uses “please contact”. The packet does not establish the legal consequence of each formulation beyond preserving the wording.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","da12aecad4e68.u10.1614","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"time","explanation":"One reading treats “following its implementation” as beginning at the 9:00am launch on 2026-02-02. A competing reading treats the general date “With effect from 2 February 2026” as the resubmission boundary, while retaining the blackout until 9:00am. The source does not specify a timezone.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"XML conformity depends on a separately provided JFIU schema, and the source promises resubmission guidance. The webinar presentation URL is supplied only in fragments. The contents of these materials are unavailable, so their requirements cannot be inferred.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u23.2943","da12aecad4e68.u25.3157","da12aecad4e68.u26.3250","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}],"questions":["Does “following its implementation” mean the 9:00am launch or the calendar date 2026-02-02?","When does urgent blackout contact constitute an actual STR submission?","What technical act satisfies the Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement?","Which timezone governs the stated times?","What are the contents of the separately provided XML schema and promised resubmission guidance?"],"readings":[{"assumptions":["The selected control is evaluated only for a classified licensed firm and an actual STR filing.","Unkno